DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10183::$$$message_0077_0000_0000$$$::I stop by the archery range.[lr]::
10184::$$$message_0077_0000_0001$$$::Sakura should be preparing for club activities during lunch break here, but...::
10185::$$$message_0077_0001_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai, hello."[lr]::
10186::$$$message_0077_0001_0001$$$::Just as I thought, the new president of the kyudo club is diligently at work.::
10187::$$$message_0077_0002_0000$$$::"Yo. I see you're doing club activities during lunch, too."[lr]::
10188::$$$message_0077_0002_0001$$$::"Huh? Oh, not really. I just came to eat lunch today."[lr]::
10189::$$$message_0077_0002_0002$$$::"I see. Well, I thought it was time to grind before the tournament."::
10190::$$$message_0077_0003_0000$$$::Shooting arrows and filling in their practice journals even during lunch[line len=2]that's what I hear that the competitive schools do.[lr]::
10191::$$$message_0077_0003_0001$$$::Our Homurahara kyudo club isn't that strict, but I can't say that goes for this season as well.::
10192::$$$message_0077_0004_0000$$$::"I suppose so, it is almost our fall tournament."[lr]::
10193::$$$message_0077_0004_0001$$$::"Mitsuzuri was saying things like there weren't enough representatives last year or something."[lr]::
10194::$$$message_0077_0004_0002$$$::"I wish we'd gone further, but I think we'll do well this year. We have a first year that's pretty talented."[lr]::
10195::$$$message_0077_0004_0003$$$::Could it be Mitsuzuri's little brother that I hear about?[lr]::
10196::$$$message_0077_0004_0004$$$::Either way, Sakura's smile is hopeful.::
10197::$$$message_0077_0005_0000$$$::"Oh, by the way, Sakura. Do you always have lunch here?"[lr]::
10198::$$$message_0077_0005_0001$$$::"Yes. I'm the one responsible for the range, after all.[lr]::
10199::$$$message_0077_0005_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服07c(中) textoff=0]They even gave me the key."[lr]::
10200::$$$message_0077_0005_0003$$$::"Good luck with that. So..."[lr]::
10201::$$$message_0077_0005_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服08l(中) textoff=0]Sakura was holding a lunch box[line len=2]no, she was holding something that was too big for one person.::
10202::$$$message_0077_0006_0000$$$::"Senpai, would you like to come inside and eat lunch with me?"[lr]::
10203::$$$message_0077_0006_0001$$$::"Are you sure? Do you have my lunch, too?"[lr]::
10204::$$$message_0077_0006_0002$$$::"Yes, I've prepared your lunch too.[lr]::
10205::$$$message_0077_0006_0003$$$::This is great timing, I was just about to invite you."::
10206::$$$message_0077_0007_0000$$$::"Well in that case, sure, I'll eat with you. Thanks."[lr]::
10207::$$$message_0077_0007_0001$$$::"Yes! Please come inside, Senpai."::
10208::$$$message_0077_0008_0000$$$::"I should warn you that it's been a little chilly for fall here."[lr]::
10209::$$$message_0077_0008_0001$$$::"Yeah, though unlike the roof, this place has walls. It's actually pretty nice. That said..."[lr]::
10210::$$$message_0077_0008_0002$$$::[se storage=se288.wav][shock vmax=20 time=800 count=3]I sit on the wooden floor in the waiting area.[lr]::
10211::$$$message_0077_0008_0003$$$::It's my first time eating lunch here.[lr]::
10212::$$$message_0077_0008_0004$$$::I've heard that Mitsuzuri and Tohsaka often drink tea here, though.::
10213::$$$message_0077_0009_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai. Let me get a cushion."[lr]::
10214::$$$message_0077_0009_0001$$$::"No, it's okay. If Mitsuzuri caught wind of someone who used to be a club member relaxing on a cushion like that, I'd never hear the end of it."[lr]::
10215::$$$message_0077_0009_0002$$$::"I see... But you're a guest, so it's fine if you use one."[lr]::
10216::$$$message_0077_0009_0003$$$::Sakura is the current captain, so she's definitely not going to use one.[lr]::
10217::$$$message_0077_0009_0004$$$::Even so, she still looks a little uncomfortable herself.::
10218::$$$message_0077_0010_0000$$$::"What about the referee seat, Senpai?"[lr]::
10219::$$$message_0077_0010_0001$$$::"It's weird eating on the tatami mat, so here is fine."[lr]::
10220::$$$message_0077_0010_0002$$$::"Okay, let's eat lunch then."[lr]::
10221::$$$message_0077_0010_0003$$$::Sakura sits next to me on the wooden floor and hands me the lunch box.[lr]::
10222::$$$message_0077_0010_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服07c(中) textoff=0]Woah[line len=3]There's quite a lot in here.::
10223::$$$message_0077_0011_0000$$$::"Then I'm gonna dig in. I owe you one."[lr]::
10224::$$$message_0077_0011_0001$$$::"Please don't worry about it, this much is a piece of cake."[lr]::
10225::$$$message_0077_0011_0002$$$::I take the chopsticks and open the lunch box.[lr]::
10226::$$$message_0077_0011_0003$$$::Salted salmon, rice, seaweed, and simmered chicken with root vegetables. It's pure Japanese style.::
10227::$$$message_0077_0012_0000$$$::"Sorry, there's a lot of things reused from breakfast."[lr]::
10228::$$$message_0077_0012_0001$$$::"No, that's only natural when you're that busy and making it. I've made plenty of meals for lunch that were from breakfast."[lr]::
10229::$$$message_0077_0012_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服03b(中) textoff=0]When I'm worn out after my part-time job, I don't have the extra capacity to figure out things for lunch.[lr]::
10230::$$$message_0077_0012_0003$$$::That changed after Sakura came.::
10231::$$$message_0077_0013_0000$$$::"There are times when Fuji-nee doesn't even realize she's been eating the same thing for three meals."[lr]::
10232::$$$message_0077_0013_0001$$$::"Really? I think Ms. Fujimura is pretty sensitive when it comes to those kinds of things."[lr]::
10233::$$$message_0077_0013_0002$$$::"To Fuji-nee, it's whether she can fill her stomach and be satisfied or not."::
10234::$$$message_0077_0014_0000$$$::"Oh... That's right, Senpai. Should I make Ms. Fujimura's lunch as well next time?"[lr]::
10235::$$$message_0077_0014_0001$$$::"I'm sure she'll be happy, but you can't spoil her. Previous experience says she'll make you do it on the regular."[lr]::
10236::$$$message_0077_0014_0002$$$::"Haaah... You must've had things hard too, Senpai."[lr]::
10237::$$$message_0077_0014_0003$$$::I nod and relish the flavor of the lightly salted salmon that fills my mouth. For her to make a Japanese-style lunch like this, Sakura's skills are immeasurable.::
10238::$$$message_0077_0015_0000$$$::"I wonder if Rider will be able to make lunch too."[lr]::
10239::$$$message_0077_0015_0001$$$::"...I don't know... I'm sure she'll try her best if we ask, but she won't have fun if it's just a job she feels obliged to do."::
10240::$$$message_0077_0016_0000$$$::"It would be fun if we could cook together with Rider...[cacheimage storage=桜制服05f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg storage=桜制服05f(中) time=300 textoff=0] Oh, but I learn best when I'm with you, of course!"[lr]::
10241::$$$message_0077_0016_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服03e(中) textoff=0]Sakura gives a nervous laugh.[lr]::
10242::$$$message_0077_0016_0002$$$::It should be fine though. That kitchen could fit the three of us.::
10243::$$$message_0077_0017_0000$$$::As we continue to eat our meals, I come to a realization.[lr]::
10244::$$$message_0077_0017_0001$$$::Isn't this...?::
10245::$$$message_0077_0018_0000$$$::"Sakura. Did you happen to swap our boxes?"[lr]::
10246::$$$message_0077_0018_0001$$$::"What? Did I? [cacheimage storage=桜制服08l(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服08l(中) textoff=0]But the chopsticks are right."[lr]::
10247::$$$message_0077_0018_0002$$$::"Oh, okay. I just thought yours looked bigger for a second."[lr]::
10248::$$$message_0077_0018_0003$$$::It must be because it looks bigger when compared to Sakura's slender legs.::
10249::$$$message_0077_0019_0000$$$::"But they're the same even if I had gotten them mixed up."[lr]::
10250::$$$message_0077_0019_0001$$$::"Is everything the same?"[lr]::
10251::$$$message_0077_0019_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服08l(中) textoff=0]So no wonder it looked big[line len=2]Wait, that's...::
10252::$$$message_0077_0020_0000$$$::"Oh... I assumed you'd have smaller portions or something."[lr]::
10253::$$$message_0077_0020_0001$$$::"Oh, haha... Well, you would get hungry in the afternoon if you had the same portion size as me..."[lr]::
10254::$$$message_0077_0020_0002$$$::"I see... But in that case, isn't that a lot for you?"[lr]::
10255::$$$message_0077_0020_0003$$$::Even for me, this is going to put me at like 80% full, nearly topped off.::
10256::$$$message_0077_0021_0000$$$::"I-it's fine! This is nothing!"[lr]::
10257::$$$message_0077_0021_0001$$$::"Fine, huh? Really?"[lr]::
10258::$$$message_0077_0021_0002$$$::I've heard that some of the other girls sometimes skip lunch, though.::
10259::$$$message_0077_0022_0000$$$::"I'm sure. It's probably because I exercise that I'm able to eat a lot."[lr]::
10260::$$$message_0077_0022_0001$$$::Hmm, so the key to dieting is not to eat less but to use up energy. Well, it doesn't seem like Sakura cares. In fact...::
10261::$$$message_0077_0023_0000$$$::"B-besides, Senpai! We're still growing!"[lr]::
10262::$$$message_0077_0023_0001$$$::"...?"[lr]::
10263::$$$message_0077_0023_0002$$$::...Sakura is still growing.[lr]::
10264::$$$message_0077_0023_0003$$$::It makes me wonder what part of her is growing.::
10265::$$$message_0077_0024_0000$$$::Without thinking, my gaze starts to drift down.[lr]::
10266::$$$message_0077_0024_0001$$$::...No, I can't. I refuse to disturb the sanctity of this space with such thoughts.::
10267::$$$message_0077_0025_0000$$$::"...Was the salmon too salty?"[lr]::
10268::$$$message_0077_0025_0001$$$::"No, lunch is good and so is your cooking. I was just thinking about how you said we were growing.[lr]::
10269::$$$message_0077_0025_0002$$$::Um, well, you know... I was mostly thinking about whether we really are still growing or not."::
10270::$$$message_0077_0026_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=300][chgfg storage=桜制服03e(中) time=300 textoff=0][say storage=sch0110_sak_0270 name=桜]You've grown taller than before, right? I'm sure you will grow even more."[lr]::
10271::$$$message_0077_0026_0001$$$::"I do want some more height... Not that I can do anything about it though. I [font italic=true]wish[font italic=false] I could just train myself to get taller."[lr]::
10272::$$$message_0077_0026_0002$$$::"I think you're worrying too much about it. You're healthy and strong to me."::
10273::$$$message_0077_0027_0000$$$::Hearing that makes me happy, even if it's flattery.[lr]::
10274::$$$message_0077_0027_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜制服07c(中) textoff=0]...Right now, I can only get stronger. If I were strong enough to be able to carry Sakura with one hand, I'd actually accept that compliment.::
10275::$$$message_0077_0028_0000$$$::"Oh, should I pour you some tea?"[lr]::
10276::$$$message_0077_0028_0001$$$::"Yes, please.[lr]::
10277::$$$message_0077_0028_0002$$$::I'll head back afterward, then."[lr]::
10278::$$$message_0077_0028_0003$$$::"Okay, Senpai."::
910236::$$$message_9077_0014_0002$$$::"Haaah... You must've had things hard too, Senpai."[r]КQ�